Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:08.49,Show Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\pos(320,110)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.49,0:00:11.16,Show Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\pos(320,110)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:15.83,Show Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\pos(320,110)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.33,0:01:33.49,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,So he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.86,0:01:35.57,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,the Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.01,0:01:38.08,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,It really is a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.08,0:01:40.80,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,So the announcements were just him acting...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.27,0:01:44.68,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,It's more mysterious and \Nexciting that way, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.32,0:01:47.04,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,So tell me, was it fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:49.30,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.30,0:01:51.22,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Do you realize how many people—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.11,0:01:54.25,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,You okay, Sane?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.25,0:01:56.35,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,C'mon, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.35,0:01:59.77,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I went out of my way to make \Nthis precious time for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.11,0:02:04.77,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Calm down. Let's have a nice, \Ncalm heart-to-heart... Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.26,0:02:07.08,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Try imagining my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.08,0:02:10.27,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,A nauseating nightmare of a bunch \Nof sleazy, power-hungry strangers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.27,0:02:13.06,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,toying around with your body, \Nmind, and life,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.06,0:02:16.39,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,only to be put on a pedestal \Nand showered with attention
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.39,0:02:18.31,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,the second you pull the golden ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.01,0:02:21.94,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,No one treated me like a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.94,0:02:23.57,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,That's why I killed them:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.57,0:02:25.62,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,to show them I have my own will, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.06,0:02:27.84,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,And that's when I found out...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.36,0:02:32.51,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,that someone had a trump card against me: the Right of Parental authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.21,0:02:34.64,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,But I was happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.64,0:02:38.89,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Happy to know that someone out there \Nwas destined to be my parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.31,0:02:43.60,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,If my parent were a person, that \Nwould make me a person too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.31,0:02:46.06,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Stay cool, Saneatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:48.90,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,The Emperor made you forfeit \Nyour Parental Authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.90,0:02:52.07,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Even if he's telling the truth, \Nit's irrelevant at this point!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.69,0:02:54.18,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Sure, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.70,0:02:57.28,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I really am glad to meet you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.69,0:02:59.83,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I have total command with Tasuketsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.83,0:03:01.58,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,And it's the best feeling in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.19,0:03:06.05,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,If I can just recover every Right, \NI can even realize my own perfect world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.05,0:03:08.87,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I'm going to make this place my Utopia!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.87,0:03:11.71,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Do you know where the Rights came from?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.71,0:03:13.22,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.22,0:03:16.91,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,They're a collection of human greed that \Nmanifested over the long course of history
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.91,0:03:21.36,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,until a certain event caused them \Nto materialize into our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.36,0:03:24.70,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Crazy, isn't it? That's what \Nthis world is coming to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.34,0:03:28.48,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Did you find that out using \Nsome other Right you recovered?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.48,0:03:31.70,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I don't know too much beyond that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.70,0:03:36.82,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Maybe if there were a God or his subjects \Nthat existed, we could ask them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.82,0:03:39.53,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,God's... subjects...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.91,0:03:43.52,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Anyway, what are you guys \Nplanning to do here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.52,0:03:45.58,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,You've already forfeited \Nyour Parental Authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.01,0:03:48.04,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,And my defenses are perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:50.70,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but you have no chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.70,0:03:54.32,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,We know your only way of killing people \Nis through Tasuketsu...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.32,0:03:56.42,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Fine, then how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.93,0:04:02.47,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,We'll take one more tally right now, and \Nin turn, I'll call that the end of Tasuketsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.56,0:04:05.81,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I can't submit questions myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.81,0:04:09.66,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,And you've killed all the puppets \Nin charge of my library...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.66,0:04:14.02,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,so I'll have you delegate the exercising power \Nof the Questionnaire Right over to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.29,0:04:17.38,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I'm now exercising my Negotiation Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.38,0:04:22.91,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,You'll take tally here and now, or you'll \Nleave and continue Tasuketsu as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.34,0:04:24.33,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.30,0:04:29.46,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I have one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.46,0:04:30.65,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.65,0:04:33.87,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Limit the scope of Tasuketsu \Nto those here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.87,0:04:38.80,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,You mean so you don't involve \Nthe others? That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.65,0:04:43.64,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Then I agree to your proposal... \Nto take the final tally.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.77,0:04:49.01,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Since you're a group and all, don't \Nyou have something I can call you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.01,0:04:50.60,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Like a team name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.87,0:04:52.06,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.89,0:04:54.61,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,It's Team Saneatsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.49,0:04:59.46,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Cool, let me check with the other three.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.46,0:05:02.45,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Answer me. Are you all Team Saneatsu?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.74,0:05:03.45,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:04.95,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.24,0:05:06.95,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.08,0:05:10.04,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Negotiation complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.04,0:05:19.28,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Hey, Saneatsu...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.18,0:05:22.90,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,this is like that one time. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.34,0:05:27.22,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Yeah, you mean that night? Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.66,0:05:29.91,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,We promised to defeat the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.91,0:05:32.09,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Thanks to that promise, \Nwe have nothing to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.56,0:05:37.65,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Can we join you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.57,0:05:42.76,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Thanks. We're in this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.76,0:05:45.54,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,We always were... and always will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.11,0:05:51.08,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,It's time. We will now \Nbegin tallying the majority.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.34,0:05:52.50,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,I reject.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.50,0:05:54.96,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs19\fad(500,1)\pos(334,59)}A question for those within the 210th floor of the Emperor's tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.50,0:05:54.96,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs30\fad(500,1)\pos(321,247)}Are you part of Team Saneatsu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.92,0:06:02.47,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.27,0:06:08.18,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,We've passed midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.04,0:06:42.71,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Idiots! Death of negotiating partners \Nnullifies agreements!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.04,0:06:45.55,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,That's the power of the \NPrime Right of Negotiation!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.55,0:06:47.89,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Complete and total victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.89,0:06:53.40,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,You greedy, rotten humans don't deserve \Nto live, even if you begged for forgiveness!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.40,0:06:55.85,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,The Right of Parental Authority \Nand its owner are both gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.85,0:06:58.18,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I have nothing to fear now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.18,0:07:03.14,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I'll kill off every human being, \Nrecover every single Right,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.14,0:07:07.11,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,and build a new, pure world free of greed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.46,0:07:11.29,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I've finally made it! \NMy ideal world is almost—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.29,0:07:13.12,Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs50}Die
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.25,0:07:15.04,Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs20\frz-5\pos(224,34)\b0}Die
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.48,0:07:16.30,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.54,0:07:21.04,Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs50\move(316,352,316,45)\c&H54431F&}Die
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.49,0:07:22.90,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.72,0:07:27.84,Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b0\fs30\pos(299,108)\clip(m 292 105 l 323 108 327 139 295 142)}Die
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.84,0:07:29.18,Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b0\fs30\pos(299,108)}Die
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.62,0:07:32.97,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,What's... happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.77,0:07:37.09,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,H-How?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.09,0:07:39.64,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,You were... dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.64,0:07:42.69,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,This is the end, Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.31,0:07:47.45,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.92,0:07:54.06,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Why... me? Why... do I have to... die?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.67,0:08:00.80,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Someone like... me... who's \Nendured... so much pain...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.80,0:08:05.38,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I could... build an... ideal... world...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.26,0:08:10.55,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,As someone who was \Nin the same boat, I can tell...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.00,0:08:14.58,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,What you're doing is repeating \Nthe same nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.11,0:08:20.45,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Ryuta-kun... how ya doing? Ya okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.08,0:08:26.83,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.48,0:08:31.54,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Looks like I was able to fuse \Nwith the puppets, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.54,0:08:34.03,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,it's taking a while to set in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.96,0:08:39.57,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,The plan was a success!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.11,0:08:41.29,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,They did it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.83,0:08:47.29,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Like this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.60,0:08:48.70,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Mm-yup...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.95,0:08:56.43,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Here's our ultimate plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.18,0:09:00.31,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,There's no doubt the Emperor \Nwill use Tasuketsu to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.73,0:09:03.97,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,First off, I'm handing the Obedience \NRight's envelopes to Gobo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.97,0:09:05.48,Flashback,Gobo,0,0,0,,R-Right on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.65,0:09:08.40,Flashback,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1)\fs40\bord1\c&H362B20&\b0\3c&H54431F&\3a&HAA&\pos(330,135)}Die
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.25,0:09:12.99,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Inside are the words "Die" for 2, "Protect" for 3, \N"Destroy" for 4, and "Love" for 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.40,0:09:09.90,Flashback,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1)\fs40\bord1\c&H362B20&\b0\3c&H54431F&\3a&HAA&\frz10.35\pos(200,100)}Protect
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:11.41,Flashback,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,1)\fs40\bord1\c&H362B20&\b0\3c&H54431F&\3a&HAA&\frz350\pos(435,100)}Destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.41,0:09:19.08,Flashback,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,300)\fs40\bord1\c&H362B20&\b0\3c&H54431F&\3a&HAA&\pos(310,90)}Love
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.99,0:09:14.98,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,They're all simple commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.98,0:09:20.71,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Of these, the command to "die" should \Nbe most useful in almost any situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.08,0:09:20.71,Flashback,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1)\fs40\bord1\c&H362B20&\b0\3c&H54431F&\3a&HAA&\pos(325,140)}Die
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.16,0:09:23.46,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,We'll use this to defeat the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.82,0:09:25.17,Flashback,Ryuta,0,0,0,,You sure it'll work?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.45,0:09:26.30,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,To make sure it does,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.30,0:09:30.13,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,we'll have to take the highest likelihood \Nof success, regardless of the risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.13,0:09:34.08,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,We'll display this command remotely \Nusing Gobo's Presentation Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.08,0:09:38.89,Flashback,Gobo,0,0,0,,Of course! That should... wait, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.89,0:09:42.12,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,The red laptop will be recovered tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.12,0:09:45.11,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Which means the Emperor will \Nhave it when we take our shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.11,0:09:46.36,Comp small -an9,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(603,57)}Two left
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.11,0:09:46.36,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(314,25)}You are currently looking at this screen
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.77,0:09:48.40,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Regardless of whether we see it or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.36,0:09:47.61,Comp small -an9,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(538,93)}One left
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.36,0:09:47.61,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(317,78)}Japanese citizens living \Nin Tokyo Prefecture
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.61,0:09:48.86,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(322,125)}Male or female
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.40,0:09:52.09,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Tasuketsu may require displaying \Ninformation on a screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.86,0:09:50.11,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(331,49)}As a result of Tasuketsu, I'm...\NAlive or Dead
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.11,0:09:51.36,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(325,35)}You are currently looking \Nat this screen in Tokyo Prefecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.36,0:09:52.61,Comp small -an9,Sign,0,0,0,,Prime Rights: 12 left\N Rights: 45 left
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.36,0:09:52.61,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,95)}40 years of age
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.36,0:09:52.61,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,173)}Under or Over
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.36,0:09:52.61,Comp small -an9,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(586,267)}1,081,990 people left
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.61,0:09:55.40,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,The Emperor can't submit \Nquestions themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.40,0:09:59.89,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,They probably can't impose \Ntheir will on Tasuketsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.89,0:10:04.11,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,So that'll be our play. \NWe'll submit the question for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.46,0:10:07.04,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,A question the Emperor most desires...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.53,0:10:10.01,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Meaning... our annihilation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.46,0:10:14.07,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,The Emperor has the power \Nto nullify submissions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.07,0:10:17.60,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,And if they do, it'll be the usual \NTasuketsu the next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.60,0:10:19.10,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,We can't let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.10,0:10:23.13,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Which is why we have to \Nall die through Tasuketsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.13,0:10:25.10,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,This is necessary for the plan to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.82,0:10:27.83,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,So we'll decide on a team name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.83,0:10:31.69,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,The Emperor will conduct Tasuketsu subjecting \Nteam members to "yes" or "no" questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.69,0:10:36.42,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,To make sure the others aren't included, \Nwe'll separate into two teams starting today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:39.48,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Those that will invade the Emperor's \Ntower are Team Saneatsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.48,0:10:42.65,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,The rest will all be under Team Yagihashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.65,0:10:46.65,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I bet the Emperor will check each \Nperson's team to make sure we all die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.20,0:10:50.50,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Omi has the Rejection Right, \Nso he can survive by rejecting tally.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.08,0:10:53.20,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,That's perfect. Your hands in your pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.20,0:10:55.59,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Pretend you're dead in that exact position.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.04,0:11:01.08,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,And Ryuta, I want you to survive by fusing \Nyourself with the cells of puppets.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.08,0:11:02.20,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.20,0:11:03.47,Flashback,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.89,0:11:07.99,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,After the Emperor takes tally, \Nact like you're desperate
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.99,0:11:10.65,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,and turn the laptop screen \Ntowards the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.99,0:11:13.63,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,With the screen facing the Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.63,0:11:17.53,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Omi will send a message on his \Ncellphone hidden in his pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.96,0:11:19.18,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Back at headquarters,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.18,0:11:22.28,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Gobo will keep an eye on Omi's cellphone \Nscreen using his Presentation Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.28,0:11:24.22,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,When Omi's message comes through,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.22,0:11:27.39,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Gobo will display command number 2 \Nto the Emperor's laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.39,0:11:29.55,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,No matter what, don't look at it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.75,0:11:33.12,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Open the envelope, unfold the note,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.12,0:11:37.90,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,and display its words on the laptop \NRyuta touches tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.90,0:11:40.93,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Omi, give the final update \Non whether the plan worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.23,0:11:42.64,Flashback,Omi,0,0,0,,Wait, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:44.31,Flashback,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Then you're saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.06,0:11:46.16,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.70,0:11:48.77,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.33,0:11:54.86,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,He was right about \Nhow everything would unfold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.21,0:11:59.40,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Mm-yup... Saneatsu was my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.40,0:12:02.83,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Even though no one will know, \Nhe saved humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.18,0:12:04.22,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.64,0:12:11.24,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,He always used to call me his hero, \Nbut turns out he's my hero now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.11,0:12:13.92,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Man...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.69,0:12:16.72,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,They're still right here, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.22,0:12:18.57,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Mm-yup...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.65,0:12:21.38,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,It's just for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.38,0:12:22.61,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Mm-yup...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.15,0:12:29.04,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,Finally... the moment I've been waiting for!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.04,0:12:32.27,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,Neither Sanetomo's son nor the Emperor \Nwere a match for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.63,0:12:34.58,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,Everything went according to plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.58,0:12:37.15,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,I've inerited the Recovery Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.15,0:12:38.97,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,Now all I need to do is wait two days
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.97,0:12:41.67,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,to recover the Rights scattered \Nfrom the Emperor's death!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.67,0:12:43.91,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,I'm the true ruler!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.52,0:12:48.54,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for this moment, Mido. \NTough luck for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.19,0:12:50.12,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,Iruga?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.12,0:12:53.92,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,You must have not noticed me hiding \Nbehind you through space division!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.92,0:12:57.02,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I would have killed you earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.02,0:13:00.63,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,but isn't it more pathetic if I do it \Nduring this victory speech of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.10,0:13:02.53,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.55,0:13:06.18,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Teppei-chan's justice came through.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.66,0:13:10.10,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I did promise Narita-chan, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.39,0:13:11.55,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,Iruga!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.97,0:13:15.13,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,"According to plan"? I'm afraid not!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.13,0:13:16.90,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Narita-chan won this match.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.14,0:13:26.37,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Divide to maximum limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.50,0:13:33.63,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Bye bye, Mido.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.50,0:13:37.86,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Welp. Now what...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.62,0:13:43.13,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I guess as long as I have this, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.99,0:13:47.60,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Gobo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.60,0:13:49.64,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I get you're happy, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.64,0:13:51.27,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.27,0:13:54.27,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Now, I've got one more big job to finish!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.80,0:13:56.47,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Let's do this, for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:14:01.84,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Hey, you sure Saneatsu and Saaya escaped?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.84,0:14:04.61,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,I {\i1}told{\i0} you, they escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.94,0:14:06.62,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,We'll meet them again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.62,0:14:08.33,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,It's almost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.33,0:14:11.33,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,1)\an1\fax-0.4\frz17.75\pos(158,161)}As of this moment,\NTasuketsu has concluded.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.21,0:14:22.04,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,It's really over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.04,0:14:22.94,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.34,0:14:25.59,Comp big-an8 - closeup blue,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(318,160)}As of this moment, Tasuketsu has concluded.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.13,0:14:25.59,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,But I wish I could have...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.13,0:14:30.59,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,seen the light at the end \Nof the tunnel together, Sane.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.00,0:14:39.56,Italics-Top,Omi,0,0,0,,June 13th. Tasuketsu came to a close.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.92,0:14:39.94,Show Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(492,245)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.61,0:14:46.54,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Driving without a license? What an outlaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.54,0:14:49.66,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Gimme a break. I'm wearing a seat belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.66,0:14:52.97,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,That's not my point. \NWhat happens if you're in an accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.97,0:14:54.22,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,We've got the Evasion Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.22,0:14:55.13,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.50,0:14:57.88,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,So where are we headed again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.88,0:15:02.76,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,To my hometown, Aomori. \NThe Emperor mentioned "God's subjects"...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.76,0:15:05.89,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,It's the same kanji as my name. \NBest to check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.89,0:15:09.64,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Besides, maybe we can channel Sane \Nif we train as one of their mediums!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.00,0:15:13.23,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Please tell me you're kidding \Nwith that spiritual woo-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.23,0:15:17.23,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,The Rights existed, so \Nwhy couldn't that be true too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.17,0:15:22.35,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,I don't expect it to come true, \Nbut it's the hope that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.35,0:15:24.21,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Isn't that what dreams are for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.30,0:15:28.93,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,And there's mountains and oceans \Nin the countryside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.93,0:15:31.91,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Unlike Tokyo, we could support ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.91,0:15:34.79,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Wow, you're one grounded guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:38.16,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Just what I'd expect from \Nthe man who saved my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.16,0:15:40.59,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Or should I say... my future husband!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.67,0:15:46.57,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,I want a girl whose more \Nof the "cute" type...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.57,0:15:50.54,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Nah, you can't stick two "cute" \Ntypes together or they'll die off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.54,0:15:52.31,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,What kind of logic is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.38,0:15:57.06,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Oh well, take me anywhere you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.32,0:15:59.60,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,I'll be your guardian angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.77,0:16:03.86,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,All right! Let's get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.86,0:16:05.35,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Hey, stop! Lemme off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.35,0:16:06.12,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,I reject!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.12,0:16:08.69,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Hey! No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.09,0:16:18.75,Default,Tetsu,0,0,0,,Damn, it's like a ghost town.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.75,0:16:21.17,Default,Sho,0,0,0,,Jeez, these have all gone bad too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.49,0:16:24.27,Default,Tetsu,0,0,0,,Must be from that week or so \Nwhen the power was out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.27,0:16:26.36,Default,Sho,0,0,0,,You mean when Tasuketsu ended?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.68,0:16:30.67,Default,Tetsu,0,0,0,,Hey, didn't Shige live around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.67,0:16:33.72,Default,Sho,0,0,0,,Um... yeah. But he's dead, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.72,0:16:36.74,Default,Tetsu,0,0,0,,Right, but his house ran \Ncompletely on electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.74,0:16:39.44,Default,Testu,0,0,0,,With power and water, we can...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.79,0:16:40.94,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Take a shower!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.34,0:16:42.88,Default,Tetsu,0,0,0,,It's still intact!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.76,0:16:46.71,Default,Sho,0,0,0,,I heard the riots got real bad around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.71,0:16:49.80,Default,Tetsu,0,0,0,,I even heard there were flying monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.04,0:16:53.53,Default,Tetsu,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you doing at Shige's place?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.53,0:16:56.45,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Oh, are you... acquaintances?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.78,0:16:59.37,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Ahh, I'm s-sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.37,0:17:01.39,Default,Tetsu,0,0,0,,You're lucky, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.39,0:17:04.46,Default,Tetsu,0,0,0,,I don't usually do this, \Nbut I'll let you choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.86,0:17:08.67,Default,Tetsu,0,0,0,,Get beat to death now or become my servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.05,0:17:12.91,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I-I'll become your servant!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.91,0:17:14.91,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Please don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.91,0:17:18.26,Default,Tetsu,0,0,0,,Ha! Sounds like you'd be perfect for the job!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.26,0:17:20.30,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I-I just used the restroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.30,0:17:24.28,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I didn't even take the canned food \Nin the kitchen, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.66,0:17:26.75,Default,Tetsu,0,0,0,,Hey, how many cans were there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.17,0:17:29.82,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Um... Maybe two full boxes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.82,0:17:32.82,Default,Tetsu,0,0,0,,Nice! All right then...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.29,0:17:35.71,Default,Tetsu,0,0,0,,Let's have some dinner before we shower!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.18,0:17:44.76,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Would you look at that. \NNew apartments have such sturdy doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.41,0:17:50.42,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You should've had your guard up when \Nyou noticed the security system was down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.79,0:17:54.79,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I'm Raion Ouno, and I love lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.79,0:17:56.32,Default,Sho,0,0,0,,Why you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.32,0:17:58.54,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Propane gas sure is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.54,0:18:00.69,Default,Sho,0,0,0,,This place runs on electricity! You did that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.69,0:18:03.06,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I lied about not stealing canned food too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.53,0:18:07.31,Default,Sho,0,0,0,,I get it... so you must \Nenjoy killing for sport too...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.31,0:18:11.44,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,"Enjoy"? You mean this \Nis just play time for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.79,0:18:14.95,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I have way better survival \Nskills than you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.32,0:18:17.41,Default,Sho,0,0,0,,You little—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.75,0:18:26.08,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You guys are the kind that \Nget caught... by a liar like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.55,0:18:27.79,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Here's another lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.25,0:18:32.61,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Besides, how do you not \Nnotice a trap like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.26,0:18:36.59,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Speaking of lies... it's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.60,0:18:42.10,Comp big-an8 - closeup blue,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(113,61)}Good evening.\NThis is your\NEmperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.60,0:18:42.10,Comp big-an8 - closeup blue,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(526,66)}Today's results \Nare as follows.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.10,0:18:43.98,Comp big-an8 - closeup blue,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs20}Today's execution has been determined to be Tamataro Yamada \N(age 33), who killed three people in Meguro Ward. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.10,0:18:43.98,Comp big-an8 - closeup blue,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs20\pos(368,160)}Please bear in mind to refrain from evil,\Nand work to live as long as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.13,0:18:46.86,Default,Man A,0,0,0,,Even with the end of Tasuketsu, \Nthe executions won't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.98,0:18:46.86,Comp big-an8 - closeup blue,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(328,37)}Please bear in mind to refrain from evil,\Nand work to live as long as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.16,0:18:49.89,Default,Man B,0,0,0,,You just have to stay out of trouble, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.71,0:18:52.90,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,There's something off about these...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.90,0:18:55.48,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,These messages reek of lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.47,0:18:59.08,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,All right, message delivered!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:19:01.49,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Hey, Nishime! Tea, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.49,0:19:03.24,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Come on, {\i1}again{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.24,0:19:07.21,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,And could you cut it out with \Nthat name? "Nishime" is food.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.33,0:19:19.30,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fs35}Shuji Nihonyanagi
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.62,0:19:09.11,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Whaddaya mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.11,0:19:12.51,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Your name is Shuji Nihonyanagi, \Nso it's "ni" and "shi" paired with "me"!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.51,0:19:14.29,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,And you're talking to a guy \Npeople call "Gobo"!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.29,0:19:17.39,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Burdock root and stewed vegetables \Nmake a good pair.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.39,0:19:19.30,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Says who?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.66,0:19:21.89,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Oh, you all done with the stream?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.89,0:19:23.89,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Hey, how did the town look?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.26,0:19:26.48,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Lots of weird stuff, but \Nnothing out of the ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.48,0:19:29.94,Default,Hikari,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san is patrolling \Nthe area right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.30,0:19:34.06,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Hey, Emperor in disguise, \Nare you eating out of hours again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.06,0:19:37.03,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,I'm the Emperor {\i1}for real{\i0} now though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.03,0:19:39.80,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Oh, {\i1}are you{\i0}? Then we need to kill you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.80,0:19:41.90,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Never mind... I was just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.53,0:19:48.65,Italics,Gobo,0,0,0,,Humanity was left with \None million people in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.65,0:19:51.88,Italics,Gobo,0,0,0,,Are we going extinct or \Nwill we reconstruct society?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.24,0:19:54.56,Italics,Gobo,0,0,0,,The only people who know \Nabout Saneatsu and Saaya's deaths
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.56,0:19:58.58,Italics,Gobo,0,0,0,,are me, Team Saneatsu, and Rika Suzuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.35,0:20:01.88,Italics,Gobo,0,0,0,,The rest of the group \Nthinks they're in hiding
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.88,0:20:04.39,Italics,Gobo,0,0,0,,because of conditions \Nfrom the Negotiation Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.39,0:20:07.56,Italics,Gobo,0,0,0,,And there's three others whose \Nwhereabouts are unknown...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.89,0:20:12.69,Italics,Gobo,0,0,0,,Ren Iruga said he killed off Mido, \Nbut he's disappeared since.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.24,0:20:15.57,Italics,Gobo,0,0,0,,There's only two left of the four volunteers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.98,0:20:19.90,Italics,Gobo,0,0,0,,Hikari and Nishime are working \Nwith me as my assistants.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.12,0:20:25.16,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,He told us to leave their bodies here...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.54,0:20:28.36,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,We could've at least saved Saaya...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.36,0:20:29.37,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.43,0:20:35.09,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Defeating the Emperor was \Nthe end for the both of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.00,0:20:40.26,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,They were sincere like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.31,0:20:46.25,Default,Hikari,0,0,0,,Eren, it's time to deliver another message.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.25,0:20:47.64,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.33,0:20:49.64,Comp small -an9,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\3c&H26271E&}Good evening. This is your Emperor.\NToday's results are as follows.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.73,0:20:53.81,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Fictional people and incidents, \Nalong with the memories of Tasuketsu...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.81,0:20:57.49,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,These three elements should ensure \Nthat people keep the peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.80,0:20:58.72,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Gobo...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.72,0:21:02.82,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Don't worry, no one will notice \Nthe Emperor's a fake!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.33,0:21:05.95,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,When did the Emperor change?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.64,0:21:07.95,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I better go meet them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.79,0:21:14.29,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,The Emperor will now become the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.65,0:21:16.43,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,And the Queen...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.88,0:21:19.88,Next Ep Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(552,350)}Closing
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.46,0:21:18.93,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,shall grant your wishes.
